{"logId": "5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 90, 192, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 90.0], [192.0, 90.0], [192.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "乘坐飞机时：", "block_bbox": [108, 169, 241, 197], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[108.0, 169.0], [241.0, 169.0], [241.0, 197.0], [108.0, 197.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、乘坐中国民航班机禁止旅客使用手机，确保处于关机状态。飞机上请勿使用手机，尤其是起飞和降落阶段。禁止使用的电子设备还有对讲机、遥控玩具和其他带遥控装置的电子设备等。", "block_bbox": [106, 205, 1096, 264], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 205.0], [1096.0, 205.0], [1096.0, 264.0], [106.0, 264.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、随身携带物品可放在上方的行李架上，较重物品可放在座位下面。\n3、如发生误机，最迟应在航班离站后的次日中午12点(含)以前到乘机机场确认。如果要求改乘后续航班，各航空公司将在航班有可利用座位的条件下予以办理，免收误机费一次。\n4、按登机牌确定的位置就座。", "block_bbox": [106, 271, 708, 297], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 271.0], [708.0, 271.0], [708.0, 297.0], [106.0, 297.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [106, 304, 1093, 363], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 304.0], [1093.0, 304.0], [1093.0, 363.0], [106.0, 363.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [107, 370, 371, 396], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 370.0], [371.0, 370.0], [371.0, 396.0], [107.0, 396.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、不要随意触动紧急出口等安全设施。", "block_bbox": [107, 404, 450, 430], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 404.0], [450.0, 404.0], [450.0, 430.0], [107.0, 430.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、不要将机上救生衣等设备带走。", "block_bbox": [106, 437, 411, 463], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 437.0], [411.0, 437.0], [411.0, 463.0], [106.0, 463.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、飞机经停某机场时千万不要不辞而别，如需改变行程，请与工作人员联系。", "block_bbox": [106, 469, 786, 497], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 469.0], [786.0, 469.0], [786.0, 497.0], [106.0, 497.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、乘坐飞机时候，请您不要和机组人员、其他旅客、朋友开关于安全的玩笑。", "block_bbox": [106, 503, 787, 530], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 503.0], [787.0, 503.0], [787.0, 530.0], [106.0, 530.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [787, 356, 1125, 530], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[787.0, 356.0], [1125.0, 356.0], [1125.0, 530.0], [787.0, 530.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 593, 1123, 641], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 593.0], [1123.0, 593.0], [1123.0, 641.0], [939.0, 641.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [121, 710, 192, 743], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 710.0], [192.0, 710.0], [192.0, 743.0], [121.0, 743.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "乘坐火车时：", "block_bbox": [131, 786, 265, 813], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[131.0, 786.0], [265.0, 786.0], [265.0, 813.0], [131.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、上车前后避免拥挤。上车时和开车前，站台上及车厢内人多拥挤，此时注意力都集中在办理上车手续、寻找车厢和座位上，容易忽略了自己的行李及口袋内的手机和钱包。因此，进站上车时要听从工作人员指挥，有序排队进站上车，避免互相拥挤给小偷制造机会。", "block_bbox": [130, 825, 741, 959], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[130.0, 825.0], [741.0, 825.0], [741.0, 959.0], [130.0, 959.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、中途停车看住行李。一些职业扒手会假扮旅客，携带简单行李，买一张短途火车票，混入车厢中，伺机作案，得手后下车逃脱。因此，列车停车前，要特别注意自己的行李物品，防止别的下车旅客拿错行李和小偷趁乱行窃。", "block_bbox": [129, 966, 744, 1101], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[129.0, 966.0], [744.0, 966.0], [744.0, 1101.0], [129.0, 1101.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、尽量减少下车购物。沿途一些停靠站由于不是封闭式车站，可能有小偷在站台上趁旅客下车购物时盗窃旅客随身携带的物品。因此，到站后旅客应尽量减少下车，如需下车购物时要多加小心。", "block_bbox": [130, 1108, 730, 1209], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[130.0, 1108.0], [730.0, 1108.0], [730.0, 1209.0], [130.0, 1209.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [787, 800, 1075, 970], "block_id": 17, "block_order": null, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[787.0, 800.0], [1075.0, 800.0], [1075.0, 970.0], [787.0, 970.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [794, 1001, 1072, 1182], "block_id": 18, "block_order": null, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[794.0, 1001.0], [1072.0, 1001.0], [1072.0, 1182.0], [794.0, 1182.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [938, 1214, 1122, 1256], "block_id": 19, "block_order": null, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[938.0, 1214.0], [1122.0, 1214.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [938.0, 1256.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5868576765060425, "coordinate": [121, 90, 192, 128], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 90.0], [192.0, 90.0], [192.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8414321541786194, "coordinate": [108, 169, 241, 197], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[108.0, 169.0], [241.0, 169.0], [241.0, 197.0], [108.0, 197.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9138140082359314, "coordinate": [106, 205, 1096, 264], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 205.0], [1096.0, 205.0], [1096.0, 264.0], [106.0, 264.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8479832410812378, "coordinate": [106, 271, 708, 297], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 271.0], [708.0, 271.0], [708.0, 297.0], [106.0, 297.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9107697010040283, "coordinate": [106, 304, 1093, 363], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 304.0], [1093.0, 304.0], [1093.0, 363.0], [106.0, 363.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8135005831718445, "coordinate": [107, 370, 371, 396], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[107.0, 370.0], [371.0, 370.0], [371.0, 396.0], [107.0, 396.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8200244903564453, "coordinate": [107, 404, 450, 430], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[107.0, 404.0], [450.0, 404.0], [450.0, 430.0], [107.0, 430.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8395496606826782, "coordinate": [106, 437, 411, 463], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 437.0], [411.0, 437.0], [411.0, 463.0], [106.0, 463.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8295420408248901, "coordinate": [106, 469, 786, 497], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 469.0], [786.0, 469.0], [786.0, 497.0], [106.0, 497.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8283765316009521, "coordinate": [106, 503, 787, 530], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[106.0, 503.0], [787.0, 503.0], [787.0, 530.0], [106.0, 530.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9103512167930603, "coordinate": [787, 356, 1125, 530], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[787.0, 356.0], [1125.0, 356.0], [1125.0, 530.0], [787.0, 530.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.3291934132575989, "coordinate": [939, 593, 1123, 641], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 593.0], [1123.0, 593.0], [1123.0, 641.0], [939.0, 641.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.48969581723213196, "coordinate": [121, 710, 192, 743], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 710.0], [192.0, 710.0], [192.0, 743.0], [121.0, 743.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7325776219367981, "coordinate": [131, 786, 265, 813], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[131.0, 786.0], [265.0, 786.0], [265.0, 813.0], [131.0, 813.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9445998668670654, "coordinate": [130, 825, 741, 959], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[130.0, 825.0], [741.0, 825.0], [741.0, 959.0], [130.0, 959.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9512057900428772, "coordinate": [129, 966, 744, 1101], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[129.0, 966.0], [744.0, 966.0], [744.0, 1101.0], [129.0, 1101.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9446916580200195, "coordinate": [130, 1108, 730, 1209], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[130.0, 1108.0], [730.0, 1108.0], [730.0, 1209.0], [130.0, 1209.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9229250550270081, "coordinate": [787, 800, 1075, 970], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[787.0, 800.0], [1075.0, 800.0], [1075.0, 970.0], [787.0, 970.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9092980027198792, "coordinate": [794, 1001, 1072, 1182], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[794.0, 1001.0], [1072.0, 1001.0], [1072.0, 1182.0], [794.0, 1182.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.4395143985748291, "coordinate": [938, 1214, 1122, 1256], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[938.0, 1214.0], [1122.0, 1214.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [938.0, 1256.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## DÍ\n\n## 乘坐飞机时：\n\n1、乘坐中国民航班机禁止旅客使用手机，确保处于关机状态。飞机上请勿使用手机，尤其是起飞和降落阶段。禁止使用的电子设备还有对讲机、遥控玩具和其他带遥控装置的电子设备等。\n\n2、随身携带物品可放在上方的行李架上，较重物品可放在座位下面。\n\n3、如发生误机，最迟应在航班离站后的次日中午12点(含)以前到乘机机场确认。如果要求改乘后续航班，各航空公司将在航班有可利用座位的条件下予以办理，免收误机费一次。\n\n4、按登机牌确定的位置就座。\n\n\n\n\n\n5、不要随意触动紧急出口等安全设施。\n\n6、不要将机上救生衣等设备带走。\n\n7、飞机经停某机场时千万不要不辞而别，如需改变行程，请与工作人员联系。\n\n8、乘坐飞机时候，请您不要和机组人员、其他旅客、朋友开关于安全的玩笑。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_787_356_1125_530.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"28%\" /></div>\n\n\n## DL\n\n## 乘坐火车时：\n\n1、上车前后避免拥挤。上车时和开车前，站台上及车厢内人多拥挤，此时注意力都集中在办理上车手续、寻找车厢和座位上，容易忽略了自己的行李及口袋内的手机和钱包。因此，进站上车时要听从工作人员指挥，有序排队进站上车，避免互相拥挤给小偷制造机会。\n\n2、中途停车看住行李。一些职业扒手会假扮旅客，携带简单行李，买一张短途火车票，混入车厢中，伺机作案，得手后下车逃脱。因此，列车停车前，要特别注意自己的行李物品，防止别的下车旅客拿错行李和小偷趁乱行窃。\n\n3、尽量减少下车购物。沿途一些停靠站由于不是封闭式车站，可能有小偷在站台上趁旅客下车购物时盗窃旅客随身携带的物品。因此，到站后旅客应尽量减少下车，如需下车购物时要多加小心。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_787_800_1075_970.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"24%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_794_1001_1072_1182.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"23%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_787_356_1125_530.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_787_356_1125_530.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F4dfda4a162cc57d976793d4664b2dd72494a9fafa65ddd738081df9b3b8d1994", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_593_1123_641.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_593_1123_641.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc2710a67da8434d31f4270bea99249216f384f422a69a660d44c4930737ca22d", "imgs/img_in_image_box_787_800_1075_970.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_787_800_1075_970.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F9aef9e3323c9bc0b857f44c27b51d3a38209da9520c81e16352619be7cb29820", "imgs/img_in_image_box_794_1001_1072_1182.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_794_1001_1072_1182.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc7555b297f781ba5fab9fd3252c1460536027b1ca96d27e7b1fabfa01b6e8ef5", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_938_1214_1122_1256.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_938_1214_1122_1256.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdc624cfc3bf3e1837fc3e318bc1aaf7bdf8a990bdb26a923f7bd02a9c6fe6926"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F8de98d34794ebf990b39f60d3aa9508a28f93e193279756dedc533d66ee98063"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F9dcee2c61869a41fa485c64614f641b1022214580e97ef36ba9ff4e25d5fc9c7"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5b933e13-8cfd-4fd1-90ab-0b33ed9fbdd8/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A53%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F67bed3728aab8125a76e23dc9aca9f0cc014d08c1acd895ee6604ac7be066a0b"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
